# Registers the external-secrets loader as a Spring Boot EnvironmentPostProcessor.
#
# IMPORTANT: EnvironmentPostProcessor implementations are discovered via
# SpringFactoriesLoader reading THIS file (META-INF/spring.factories) — the same
# way Spring Boot registers its own (ConfigData…, SystemEnvironmentPropertySource…,
# RandomValuePropertySource…, etc.). The META-INF/spring/<fqn>.imports convention
# is ONLY for @AutoConfiguration, NOT for EnvironmentPostProcessor. The loader was
# previously registered solely in an .imports file, which Spring silently ignored,
# so it never ran and provider API keys never injected (every LLM call 401'd).
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
com.emergentterrain.secrets.ExternalSecretsEnvironmentPostProcessor
